class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8 \"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-cyan-400/20 bg-cyan-400/10 px-5 py-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-400\">About Novomentum</span></div><div class=\"mt-8 max-w-4xl\"><h1 class=\"text-6xl font-black leading-tight\">Helping businesses create momentum through technology and AI.</h1><p class=\"mt-8 text-xl leading-9 text-slate-400\">Novomentum helps organizations modernize Microsoft 365, automate business processes, deploy practical AI, and build secure technology that creates measurable business outcomes.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-32 \"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8 \"><div class=\"grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-10 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,.12)] \"><div class=\"mb-6 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-cyan-400/10 p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-brain-circuit h-8 w-8 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M9 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3-4\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516\"></path><path d=\"M12 13h4\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h8\"></path><path d=\"M16 8V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"13\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"3\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"21\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"8\" r=\".5\"></circle></svg></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Practical AI</h2><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-400\">We focus on AI solutions that solve real business problems and deliver measurable results.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-10 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,.12)] \"><div class=\"mb-6 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-cyan-400/10 p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-8 w-8 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Security First</h2><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-400\">Every solution is designed with Microsoft security, governance, and best practices in mind.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-10 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,.12)] \"><div class=\"mb-6 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-cyan-400/10 p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb h-8 w-8 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Business Focused</h2><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-400\">Technology should support business goals—not become another project to manage.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-10 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,.12)] \"><div class=\"mb-6 inline-flex rounded-2xl bg-cyan-400/10 p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rocket h-8 w-8 text-cyan-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z\"></path><path d=\"m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0\"></path><path d=\"M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Create Momentum</h2><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-400\">Our mission is to help organizations move faster through automation, AI, and modern cloud technologies.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-32 \"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8 \"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-10 backdrop-blur transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(34,211,238,.12)] text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-5xl font-black\">Let&#x27;s build something better.</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-8 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-9 text-slate-400\">Whether you&#x27;re exploring AI, Microsoft 365, or automation, we&#x27;ll help you build a practical roadmap that delivers measurable business results.</p><div class=\"mt-10\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl px-8 py-4 text-lg font-semibold transition-all duration-300 bg-cyan-400 text-black hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-cyan-300 hover:shadow-[0_0_35px_rgba(34,211,238,.35)]\" href=\"/contact\">Book Free St